      "citation": "73-5-45",
      "text": "Sections\n73-5-1\nthrough\n73-5-43\n, Mississippi Code of 1972, which create the State Board of Barber Examiners and prescribe its duties and powers, shall stand repealed as of July 1, 2025.\nLaws, 1979, ch. 301, \u00a7 21; Laws, 1979, ch. 357, \u00a7 7; Laws, 1983, ch. 489, \u00a7 23; Laws, 1991, ch. 508 \u00a7 24; Laws, 1997, ch. 511, \u00a7 24; reenacted and amended, Laws, 2002, ch. 558, \u00a7 23; Laws, 2004, ch. 309, \u00a7 24; Laws, 2008, ch. 303, \u00a7 24; Laws, 2011, ch. 322, \u00a7 1, eff. 7/1/2011.\nReenacted and amended by Laws, 2020, ch. 409, SB 2307,\u00a7 24, eff. 7/1/2020.\nAmended by Laws, 2016, ch. 308, SB 2528, 1, eff. 7/1/2016.",
